{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A bare `as text` on a literal does NOT read the .md extension as a kind:\nthe value is the string \"readme.md\", not a markdown document. Kind stays\nnull — it comes only from an explicit `as text/<kind>` or a producing action.",
